Description: urma: fix forward compatibility for urma_perftest
 Make urma_perftest compatible with older peer binaries: single-device DUPLEX
 falls back to fixed-length sync instead of the variable-length delegated sync
 used by bonding devices, and all remote resource handling (seg/rjetty/jetty id)
 now dispatches on whether the corresponding remote arrays were allocated rather
 than on the jetty mode, building stack fallback objects when they were not.
Author: Qian Tao <qiantao6@huawei.com>
Origin: upstream, https://gitcode.com/openeuler/umdk/commit/1b0abfdaa1252c87da791867bdb02c1dba1ae039
Bug: https://gitcode.com/openeuler/umdk/issues/756
Last-Update: 2026-07-29
